    raw_med = [('Under MGNREGA, if an applicant is not provided wage employment within 15 days of applying, they are legally entitled to:', 'A daily Unemployment Allowance paid by the State Government', ['A lump-sum grant of Rs 1 lakh', 'Automatic permanent recruitment into state civil police', 'Free commercial agricultural land in the district'], 'Section 7 of MGNREGA mandates payment of daily unemployment allowance if work is not allotted within 15 days.'), ('In MGNREGA implementation, what is the mandatory minimum percentage of beneficiaries that must be women?', 'At least 33% (one-third) of total person-days', ['At least 50%', 'At least 20%', 'At least 10%'], 'Schedule I of MGNREGA mandates that at least one-third of participating wage laborers must be women.'), ('Under MGNREGA, what is the legally prescribed statutory wage-material expenditure ratio at the Gram Panchayat level?', '60:40 (60% unskilled wages to 40% skilled labor and materials)', ['50:50 ratio', '75:25 ratio', '90:10 ratio'], 'The 60:40 ratio ensures MGNREGA remains primarily a labor-intensive social protection safety net.'), ("The 'Ayushman Bharat Digital Mission' (ABDM) creates which core digital identifier for citizens?", 'ABHA (Ayushman Bharat Health Account) 14-digit Health ID', ['Aadhaar Card', 'PAN Card', 'DigiLocker PIN'], 'ABHA digitally links electronic personal health records, diagnostic reports, and hospital visits across providers.'), ("The 'PM-ABHIM' (Pradhan Mantri Ayushman Bharat Health Infrastructure Mission) is aimed at:", 'Filling critical gaps in primary, secondary, and tertiary public healthcare infrastructure and disease surveillance', ['Privatizing all district government civil hospitals', 'Subsidizing overseas medical tourism trips', 'Banning all traditional Ayurvedic medicines'], 'PM-ABHIM establishes critical care hospital blocks, biosafety labs, and integrated public health laboratories.'), ("The 'Pradhan Mantri Matru Vandana Yojana' (PMMVY) provides maternity cash incentives to pregnant and lactating mothers for:", 'First two living children to compensate for wage loss and promote institutional health seeking', ['All children up to ten births unconditionally', 'Only mothers working in central government offices', 'Families with annual income exceeding Rs 50 lakh'], 'PMMVY provides cash incentives in installments for institutional delivery, vaccinations, and nutrition.'), ("Under the 'PM TB Mukt Bharat Abhiyaan', community donors supporting nutritional food baskets for TB patients are called:", "'Ni-kshay Mitras'", ["'Swachhata Doots'", "'Arogya Mitras'", "'Kisan Mitras'"], 'Ni-kshay Mitras provide diagnostic, nutritional, and vocational support to eliminate tuberculosis by 2025.'), ("The 'Pradhan Mantri Krishi Sinchayee Yojana' (PMKSY) focuses on which two strategic irrigation pillars?", "'Har Khet Ko Pani' (Water to Every Field) and 'Per Drop More Crop' (Micro-irrigation)", ['River interlinking and deep-sea desalinization', 'Unrestricted flood irrigation in all river basins', 'Building concrete canals through national sanctuaries'], 'PMKSY combines Accelerated Irrigation Benefit Programme (AIBP) with drip and sprinkler micro-irrigation systems.'), ("The 'Paramparagat Krishi Vikas Yojana' (PKVY) promotes which specific farming methodology in India?", 'Organic farming through cluster formation and Participatory Guarantee System (PGS) certification', ['High-chemical pesticide intensive monoculture', 'Genetically modified terminator seed farming', 'Industrial hydroponics in skyscrapers'], 'PKVY adopts traditional organic farming without synthetic chemicals, facilitating domestic organic market access.'), ("The 'Production Linked Incentive' (PLI) Scheme across 14 manufacturing sectors provides financial incentives based on:", 'Incremental sales of goods manufactured in India over a base year (ranging 4% to 6%)', ['Total historical real estate property taxes paid', 'The number of foreign consultants hired on contracts', 'Total electrical power consumed by factory boilers'], 'PLI attracts global supply chains, boosts domestic value addition, and scales export competitiveness.'), ("The 'Skill India Mission's' Pradhan Mantri Kaushal Vikas Yojana (PMKVY) includes 'RPL', which stands for:", 'Recognition of Prior Learning', ['Rural Public Livelihood', 'Repayable Professional Loan', 'Regional Polytechnic League'], 'RPL formally assesses and certifies existing informal skills acquired through experience to align with national NSQF standards.'), ("The 'PM Gati Shakti National Master Plan' integrates infrastructure projects across departments using which GIS platform?", 'BISAG-N (Bhaskaracharya National Institute for Space Applications and Geo-informatics)', ['Google Maps Pro exclusively', 'OpenStreetMap Foundation', 'NASA Earth Observatory'], 'BISAG-N provides dynamic 3D multi-layer spatial GIS planning to optimize logistics and prevent utility cutting conflicts.'), ("The 'Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana - Urban' (PMAY-U) operates through four distinct vertical delivery models:", 'In-situ Slum Redevelopment, CLSS (Credit Linked Subsidy), AHP (Affordable Housing in Partnership), and BLC', ['Direct cash handouts without building verification', 'Renting five-star private hotel suites', 'Mandatory relocation of all urban residents to villages'], 'PMAY-U provides pucca houses with tap water, toilets, and electricity through four targeted beneficiary verticals.'), ("The 'Integrated Command and Control Centres' (ICCC) established under the Smart Cities Mission serve as:", 'The brain and nervous system of cities for integrated traffic, municipal services, emergency response, and surveillance', ['Exclusive underground bomb shelters for politicians', 'Corporate private banking transaction servers', 'Air traffic control towers for military fighter jets'], 'ICCCs combine real-time sensors, smart street lighting, traffic enforcement, and municipal grievance management.'), ("The 'National Green Hydrogen Mission' approved by the Union Cabinet targets an annual green hydrogen production of:", 'At least 5 Million Metric Tonnes (MMT) per annum by 2030', ['500 Million Metric Tonnes by 2025', 'Zero production due to nuclear phase-out', '10,000 liters for laboratory experiments only'], 'The mission aims to decarbonize steel, mobility, and fertilizer sectors while replacing fossil fuel imports.'), ("The 'Sovereign Green Bonds' issued by the Government of India are utilized exclusively to finance:", 'Public sector green infrastructure projects (solar, wind, small hydro, clean public transit)', ['Thermal coal-fired power station expansions', 'Executive foreign diplomatic aircraft purchases', 'Commercial tobacco farming subsidies'], 'Proceeds from Sovereign Green Bonds fund clean energy, climate adaptation, and environmental pollution abatement.'), ("The 'PM-PRANAM' scheme announced in the Union Budget is designed to incentivize States and UTs to:", 'Promote alternative fertilizers and balanced, reduced use of chemical fertilizers (Urea)', ['Increase subsidies on synthetic chemical pesticides', 'Mandate 100% chemical weedicides in rice paddies', 'Abolish all organic agricultural cooperative mandis'], 'PM-PRANAM passes 50% of fertilizer subsidy savings back to states for alternative nutrient technologies.'), ("The 'MISHTI' initiative (Mangrove Initiative for Shoreline Habitats & Tangible Incomes) focuses on:", "Mangrove afforestation and eco-restoration along India's coastline and salt pan lands", ['Planting pine trees on desert sand dunes', 'Commercial prawn aquaculture destroying coral reefs', 'Deep-sea bottom dredging for luxury cruises'], 'MISHTI leverages CAMPA funds and MGNREGA convergence to restore carbon-dense coastal mangrove buffers.'), ("The 'Amrit Dharohar' scheme launched under the Union Budget aims to promote the conservation of:", 'Ramsar wetland sites to sustain aquatic biodiversity, eco-tourism, and carbon storage', ['Historic Mughal and British palaces in cities', 'Deep underground gold and diamond mines', 'Commercial inland shipping cargo container terminals'], 'Amrit Dharohar conserves Ramsar sites, enhancing local community livelihoods and wetland ecosystem services.'), ("The 'National Clean Air Programme' (NCAP) targets reducing particulate matter (PM10 and PM2.5) concentrations in:", '131 non-attainment cities across India that fail to meet National Ambient Air Quality Standards', ['Only five metropolitan capital cities', 'Every individual agricultural village in India', 'All coastal maritime beach resorts exclusively'], 'NCAP formulates comprehensive city action plans targeting 20-30% reduction in PM pollution.'), ("The 'Mission LiFE' (Lifestyle for Environment) global public movement introduced by India at COP26 advocates:", 'Individual and community sustainable mindful utilization rather than mindless and destructive consumption', ['Abandoning all modern medical healthcare technologies', 'Banning all electrical lighting and refrigeration', 'Relocating all urban populations to forest caves'], 'Mission LiFE mobilizes citizens to adopt eco-friendly behaviors across energy, water, plastic, and food waste.'), ("The 'One Nation One Ration Card' (ONORC) technology platform empowers migrant laborers to:", 'Lift their entitled subsidized food grains from any Fair Price Shop across the country using biometric authentication', ['Vote in all state assembly elections simultaneously', 'Travel free on commercial domestic passenger airlines', 'Avoid paying all local municipal sales taxes'], 'ONORC uses electronic PoS devices and Aadhaar seeding to ensure seamless nationwide ration portability.'), ("The 'SVAMITVA' scheme deployed by the Ministry of Panchayati Raj utilizes drone technology to:", "Survey rural inhabited abadi land and issue legal 'Property Cards' to village household owners", ['Spray chemical aerial pesticides over national forests', 'Monitor private personal telephone calls of citizens', 'Track migration routes of wild tigers in national parks'], 'SVAMITVA maps rural residential properties to provide clear titles, enabling institutional credit and reducing disputes.'), ("The 'BharatNet' project implemented by Bharat Broadband Network Limited (BBNL) is aimed at:", 'Connecting all 2.5 lakh Gram Panchayats with high-speed optical fiber broadband connectivity', ['Building national four-lane highway bypasses', 'Launching private television entertainment channels', 'Operating luxury long-distance tourist train coaches'], 'BharatNet provides the core digital telecom backbone for delivery of e-health, e-education, and e-governance to villages.'), ("The 'PM Gati Shakti Sanchar' portal serves as an integrated digital portal for:", 'Expeditious approvals of Right of Way (RoW) for telecommunications and 5G fiber laying infrastructure', ['Booking long-distance railway freight wagons', 'Applying for commercial passports and foreign visas', 'Monitoring international diplomatic embassy mail'], 'Sanchar portal streamlines statutory clearances for telecom towers and underground optical fiber lines across states.'), ("The 'PM-KUSUM' (Pradhan Mantri Kisan Urja Suraksha evam Utthaan Mahabhiyan) promotes farmers':", 'Installation of standalone solar water pumps and solarization of grid-connected agricultural pumps', ['Dependence on diesel generators for deep tube-well pumping', 'Construction of thermal coal power plants on farm lands', 'Sale of agricultural lands to private solar developers'], 'PM-KUSUM de-dieselizes agriculture, provides clean energy irrigation, and creates income by selling surplus solar power.'), ("The 'National Nutrition Mission' (POSHAN Abhiyaan) monitors and aims to reduce which child health indicators?", 'Stunting, Wasting, Underweight, and Anemia among children, adolescent girls, and women', ['Visual myopia and dental tooth decay only', 'Height growth exceeding two meters', 'Average running speed in school sports'], 'POSHAN Abhiyaan targets multi-sectoral convergence to reduce stunting and low birth weight by 2% per annum.'), ("The 'Kisan Credit Card' (KCC) facility was extended in 2018-19 to cater to the working capital needs of:", 'Fisheries and Animal Husbandry farmers (dairy and poultry)', ['Commercial space satellite launch corporations', 'Luxury automobile import dealerships', 'Foreign tourist cruise ship operators'], 'KCC provides concessional institutional short-term credit at 4% effective interest (with prompt repayment subvention).'), ("The 'Agriculture Infrastructure Fund' (AIF) provides medium-to-long term debt financing facility for:", 'Post-harvest management infrastructure and community farming assets (cold chains, silos, assaying units)', ['Purchasing luxury foreign tractors for executive races', 'Constructing chemical manufacturing weapon plants', 'Subsidizing private corporate golf courses'], 'AIF provides Rs 1 lakh crore financing with 3% interest subvention and CGTMSE credit guarantee coverage.'), ("Under the 'PM Matsya Sampada Yojana' (PMMSY), the flagship marine and inland scheme aims to:", 'Ecologically modernize fisheries, double fishermen incomes, and expand seafood export earnings', ['Ban all fish consumption nationwide', 'Drain coastal estuaries for airport construction', 'Dredge ocean trenches for deep mining exclusively'], 'PMMSY addresses infrastructure gaps across marine, inland, and brackish water aquaculture value chains.'), ("The 'National Ayush Mission' (NAM) supports the development and mainstreaming of which healthcare systems?", 'Ayurveda, Yoga and Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha, and Homoeopathy (AYUSH)', ['Allopathic surgical oncology hospitals exclusively', 'Veterinary equestrian clinics exclusively', 'Commercial pharmaceutical synthetic manufacturing'], 'NAM integrates traditional medicine systems into the public primary healthcare delivery network.'), ("The 'PM SHRI Schools' (PM Schools for Rising India) initiative upgrades 14,500 schools to:", 'Exemplary model schools showcasing implementation of the National Education Policy (NEP) 2020', ['Military cadet boarding academies exclusively', 'Online-only virtual computer gaming centers', 'Commercial private coaching centers for competitive tests'], 'PM SHRI schools feature modern pedagogy, smart classrooms, green infrastructure, and experiential learning.'), ("The 'Lakhpati Didi' flagship rural development initiative aims to empower rural women in SHGs to:", 'Earn a sustainable sustainable annual household income of at least Rs 1 lakh through diversified micro-enterprises', ['Win commercial national lottery jackpots', 'Receive free overseas luxury vacation tickets', 'Acquire commercial real estate in metropolitan capitals'], 'Lakhpati Didi provides skill training, credit linkage, and market access in agriculture, animal husbandry, and handicrafts.')]
